{"id": "adapter-https", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "HTTPS adapter engineering checklist", "title": "HTTPS adapter engineering checklist", "content": "Receive HTTP requests using an HTTPS sender. Specify a unique endpoint address and validate the authentication mode against tenant policy. Test with a correlation identifier and verify response status and the matching message processing log.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109252+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["HTTPS"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "9d9f4ec66dd77837bf9a0d79ce62cd8a73fce042de23f6b9cb99c4517380e563", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "adapter-http", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "HTTP adapter engineering checklist", "title": "HTTP adapter engineering checklist", "content": "An HTTP receiver invokes a destination URL. Externalize the receiver URL and reference managed credentials. Configure allowed methods, timeout and error handling. Verify endpoint reachability and a controlled test response.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109467+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["HTTP"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "da8535b23258fef01819cbed8e65882f58e0d3d7484fa58eeeef69c8e908f171", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "adapter-odatav4", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "ODataV4 adapter engineering checklist", "title": "ODataV4 adapter engineering checklist", "content": "An OData V4 receiver uses service metadata and entity operations. Confirm service version and expected payload shape. Reference an approved OAuth2 client credentials alias when required. Verify the target entity response and correlated MPL.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109483+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["ODataV4"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "cc61bd3f9b1e8952f860ca188306062faf96fa3dd6ab585d002b9c95735dd09c", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "adapter-odatav2", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "ODataV2 adapter engineering checklist", "title": "ODataV2 adapter engineering checklist", "content": "OData V2 and V4 payload and service contracts differ. Inspect metadata and operation support before configuring the adapter. Externalize the endpoint and use an approved security alias. Test a known entity request.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109492+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["ODataV2"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "64f7b428c0b31366fcdb26a4f3d0b5cd309d3ae0939aff5103d3a0d31ddb42d7", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "adapter-sftp", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "SFTP adapter engineering checklist", "title": "SFTP adapter engineering checklist", "content": "An SFTP sender polls a remote directory. Validate host key trust, directory, file filters and duplicate processing policy. Store authentication in security material and use alias references. Never embed a password in a flow or trajectory.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109500+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["SFTP"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "ea02c8c1eb0054d7a7ce3591ab3c635427e74d3e30706c39b6c6eb46e34477e6", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "adapter-soap", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "SOAP adapter engineering checklist", "title": "SOAP adapter engineering checklist", "content": "SOAP integration requires a service contract, operation, namespaces and XML payload. Confirm SOAP version and endpoint authentication. Test generated XML with expected namespaces before deployment.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109508+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["SOAP"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "6a63781d9650ec6bc323bd51a4f6ea2e4ecabe94e7f8570604cb96c44cdb3ab7", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "adapter-jms", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "JMS adapter engineering checklist", "title": "JMS adapter engineering checklist", "content": "Use JMS for asynchronous decoupling and bounded retry of recoverable errors. Ensure tenant JMS entitlement and queue configuration exist. Configure redelivery limits and dead-letter handling, and prevent duplicate effects with idempotency.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109515+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["JMS"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "59387ebc1d15187e50c38b0520f0c5c6485a95c034deeff2ddc92dbb35ca9d7e", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "adapter-eventmesh", "document_type": "text", "collection": "adapters", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "EventMesh adapter engineering checklist", "title": "EventMesh adapter engineering checklist", "content": "Event Mesh integrates asynchronous publishers and consumers through configured queues/topics. Validate subscription permissions and delivery semantics. Handle duplicate messages and test correlation across asynchronous boundaries.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109523+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": ["EventMesh"], "applicable_actions": ["CONFIGURE_ADAPTER"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "f7370ba34aa59a20c85f9333da73e4caceb579899b3cfa3ab4eb2a68e4334cce", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "component-contentmodifier", "document_type": "pattern", "collection": "components", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "ContentModifier component pattern", "title": "ContentModifier component pattern", "content": "Set message body, headers or exchange properties. Keep secret values in managed credential stores. Verify the intended content modifier exists in the process and check transformation output with a fixture.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109531+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": [], "applicable_actions": ["ADD_COMPONENT"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "9c88c9abb1598d8eae5bd8601d7397a430c7a22485ee630c7eaf611592d47aa0", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "component-router", "document_type": "pattern", "collection": "components", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "Router component pattern", "title": "Router component pattern", "content": "A router selects routes using configured conditions and a default route. Define exhaustive conditions where required and test both matching and default branches. Insert relative to a named component, never a fixed screen coordinate.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109539+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": [], "applicable_actions": ["ADD_COMPONENT"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "4e80ddd8a5220acb5fdb3476b93990c763c8dbd87fcd8b3dbe63873437a84287", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "component-splitter", "document_type": "pattern", "collection": "components", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "Splitter component pattern", "title": "Splitter component pattern", "content": "A splitter produces multiple messages from a selected payload path. Specify grouping and parallelism deliberately. Test empty, single and multiple-item inputs and verify downstream aggregation semantics.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109546+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": [], "applicable_actions": ["ADD_COMPONENT"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "4dbd4df95433bd0c81ff909440ce04977b34c875bc841f72ee349d81e3901d7c", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "component-gather", "document_type": "pattern", "collection": "components", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "Gather component pattern", "title": "Gather component pattern", "content": "A gather combines messages produced by splitting or multicast. Match the aggregation mode to the payload format and verify ordering requirements.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109554+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": [], "applicable_actions": ["ADD_COMPONENT"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "315826507bf9dd478e9d2a7664ff6569838afba964c8935c800132c6053d7d73", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "component-processdirect", "document_type": "pattern", "collection": "components", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "ProcessDirect component pattern", "title": "ProcessDirect component pattern", "content": "ProcessDirect connects integration flows within the supported runtime scope. Verify an active consumer address exists before invoking it. Missing consumers may produce DirectVmConsumerNotAvailableException.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109561+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": [], "applicable_actions": ["ADD_COMPONENT"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "f8ec9bff0748f38caf8f7aaedf83d0e8ce792beb5be4c87bed077fdca3669fe4", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "component-exceptionsubprocess", "document_type": "pattern", "collection": "components", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "ExceptionSubprocess component pattern", "title": "ExceptionSubprocess component pattern", "content": "An exception subprocess defines controlled failure handling. Preserve correlation information, redact payload secrets and distinguish transient failures from permanent business errors.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109570+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": [], "applicable_actions": ["ADD_COMPONENT"], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": [], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "b483ba3143d9e36e0bb351db2556e99ff853eec151ac8ab91b59ae3e00b342b0", "facts": {}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
{"id": "pattern-https_to_http", "document_type": "iflow_template", "collection": "architecture_patterns", "sap_product": "Integration Suite", "sap_module": "Cloud Integration", "topic": "HTTPS TO HTTP architecture", "title": "HTTPS TO HTTP architecture", "content": "HTTPS TO HTTP requires a sender, validated transformation, a receiver and independent runtime verification. Prefer a tenant-approved exported iFlow artifact template. Externalize endpoints and reference credential aliases. Save before deploy, send a correlated test and check both response and MPL. A blueprint is not a deployable SAP artifact until its exported template is validated.", "source": "internal:curated-v1", "source_version": "1", "source_date": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T18:26:13.109580+00:00", "tenant_scope": "global", "customer_scope": "global", "security_classification": "public", "tags": [], "applicable_actions": [], "applicable_errors": [], "artifact_types": ["iflow_blueprint"], "embedding_version": "", "hash": "02aa43e3e13662d850eceecc7df6b90777f1e18edcf795b9c005fce2cb1757e4", "facts": {"template_status": "requires_approved_export"}, "approved": true, "license": "internal-original", "provenance_kind": "original"}
